# CMDEDIT-MISC-03: feedback add over the box and a triangle; count; why; save; clear x.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load input/c
box 0 0 4 4
feedback add "x"
feedback add "p" solid 0 0 10 0 0 10
feedback count
feedback why
feedback save f.tcl
feedback clear x
feedback count
